  "prefLabel": "Ed 1114.02 Definition",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1114.02 Definition. As used in Ed 1114, “governing body” means the individual or group of individuals legally responsible for the policies, operations, and activities of a private provider of special education or other non-LEA program.\n\nSource. (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Ed 1100) #9197, eff 6-28-08; ss by #12141, eff 3-24-17",
